    "text_excerpt": "Please remit all payments to: payments@premiumcoat.ca\nThanks for your business!\n15337810 Canada Inc\n516 Whitmore Avenue\nToronto ON M6E 2N8\n437-441-2531\nwww.premiumcoat.ca\nGST/HST Registration No.: 791283153\nBusiness Number 791283153\nBILL TO\nOttawa Painters\n2377 Walkley Rd\nOttawa, ON K1G 3H1\nINVOICE FM-149\nDATE 21/03/2026 TERMS Due on receipt\nDUE DATE 23/03/2026\nDATE ACTIVITY QTY RATE AMOUNT\n16/03/2026 Painting Services\nJob #2413005: Laura Van Cleef\nAt: 13 Shannondoe Crescent\nOttawa, ON K2M 2H1\nComprehensive interior preparation including full surface \npreparation (caulking, wood filler application on trims and \nbaseboards), plaster repairs to walls and ceilings (scratches, nail \nholes, dents, uneven areas) and spot priming where required.\nProfessional interior painting throughout the residence including \nwalls and ceilings (2-3 finish coats) to ensure a uniform and durable \nfinish.\nProtection of floors, fixtures and surrounding areas during the \npreparation and painting process, followed by a full cleanup upon \nproject completion.\n16,000.00 6,000.00\n16/03/2026 Plaster\nTaping and plaster repair work on walls and ceilings in indicated \nareas, including materials.\n1 140.00 140.00\n20/03/2026 Material Reimbursement\nSherwin Williams INVOICE\nNo. 88024182730326 (Paint)\n1 135.85 135.85\n20/03/2026 Material Reimbursement\nSherwin Williams INVOICE\nNo. 31467198110326 (Paint and consumables)\n1 124.32 124.32\nWe appreciate your business and look forward to helping you \nagain soon!\nSUBTOTAL 6,400.17\nHST (ON) @ 13% 832.02\n\nPlease remit all payments to: payments@premiumcoat.ca\nThanks for your business!\nTOTAL 7,232.19\n$7,232.19TOTAL DUE\nTAX SUMMARY\nRATE TAX NET\nHST (ON) @ 13% 832.02 6,400.17",
